UnitPrice: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column kind text
column price bigint
column price_currency char(3)
column per numeric(38, 9) -- Mass in kilograms (kg) when kind is per_mass; Volume in cubic metres (m³) when kind is per_volume; Length in metres (m) when kind is per_length; Area in square metres (m²) when kind is per_area

example {"tag":"per_mass","price":{"amount":250,"currency":"GBP"},"per":{"value":"1","unit":"kg"}}
text none
json {"tag":"per_mass","price":{"amount":250,"currency":"GBP"},"per":{"value":"1","unit":"kg"}}
stored kind 'per_mass'
stored price 250
stored price_currency 'GBP'
stored per 1

